          <Pad Id="G4UT3OlL4qvIl0iA6Yqtis" Bounds="640,458,320,80" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Zoom around the pixel under the cursor. Notch Size is 1 because that is what VL reports per notch; a MIDI or native source may send 120.">
